      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to feel your family history looping through you, but remember that inheritance doesn't have to mean repetition. Therapy is often the very tool needed to break these inherited patterns before you feel they are becoming inevitable. You are not your ancestors or their story; your present choices shape a different future for you.",
