      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is entirely understandable to feel exhausted when the outcome seems predetermined, and sometimes surrendering the fight offers a necessary moment of peace. However, living without any agency over your life path can be just as overwhelming as the constant struggle. Even if the storm feels inevitable to you, you are still given the power to decide how you endure it or how much life you choose to accept before it happens. Please remember that seeking help isn't about winning an argument against biology; it's about finding strength and support so you can navigate this storm without losing yourself.",
